{"id":"15b4ec6f9c001e43","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-prop-ground-ax.md","title":"Ground Axiom","display":"prop-ground-ax — Ground Axiom","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-ground-ax","aliases":["58-prop-ground-ax"],"display":"prop-ground-ax — Ground Axiom","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-ground-ax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-ground-ax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ground-ax — Ground Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"031def7d5c89ab92\" href=\"?note=031def7d5c89ab92\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md\">../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(M,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> are class-model variables.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S\\)</span> are the class-level predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"031def7d5c89ab92\" href=\"?note=031def7d5c89ab92\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md\">../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ground\\text{-}ax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq M\n\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,M)\\to W=M\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ground\\text{-}ax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq M\n\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,M)\\to W=M\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cited ground predicate permits the trivial presentation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=M\">\\(W=M\\)</span>; the displayed implication therefore excludes exactly the proper grounds.</li>\n<li>Both the universe and its grounds are class models, not set-coded members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"031def7d5c89ab92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"031def7d5c89ab92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$, $\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$, and $\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S$ are the class-level predicates from [[../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ground\\text{-}ax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq M\n\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,M)\\to W=M\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"W=M","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":963,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3964","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-prop-ground-ax.md|58-prop-ground-ax]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["031def7d5c89ab92"]}